1)Store documents
    Word, Excel, PDF, PowerPoint, images, etc.

2)Folders/subfolders
    Organize documents into folder structures.

3)Metadata / Columns
    Add information about each document.
    Example: Department, Request Number, Status, Document Type.
    Document Library ≈ Table
    Each document ≈ Record
    Metadata columns ≈ Table columns

      ex:
          For example, the actual PDF is the file, while:
          Status = Approved
          Department = Finance
          Request Number = BR-001
          are properties describing that file.
